{"id":"53f1b3025ce14af2","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-pbextension.md","title":"Extensions to the solid cube and convexity","display":"df-pbextension — Extensions to the solid cube and convexity","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-pbextension","aliases":["27-df-pbextension"],"display":"df-pbextension — Extensions to the solid cube and convexity","depends_on":["[[27-df-pseudobool]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§13.3; §13.3.2","source_statement":"Definition 13.6; concave and convex extensions","source_printed_pages":"578; 581","source_pdf_pages":"602; 605","verification_status":"source-definition-checked","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-pbextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-pbextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-pbextension — Extensions to the solid cube and convexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§13.3; §13.3.2"},{"key":"source_statement","html":"Definition 13.6; concave and convex extensions"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"578; 581"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"602; 605"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" href=\"?note=04a7d534f0d6e0dd\" title=\"27-df-pseudobool\">27-df-pseudobool</a>）；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\(N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U_n\\coloneqq[0,1]^N,\\qquad \\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)=f(a))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U_n\\coloneqq[0,1]^N,\\qquad \\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)=f(a))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convex}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x,y\\in U_n\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g((tx_i+(1-t)y_i)_{i\\in N})\\leq tg(x)+(1-t)g(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Convex}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x,y\\in U_n\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g((tx_i+(1-t)y_i)_{i\\in N})\\leq tg(x)+(1-t)g(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Concave}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x,y\\in U_n\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g((tx_i+(1-t)y_i)_{i\\in N})\\geq tg(x)+(1-t)g(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Concave}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x,y\\in U_n\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g((tx_i+(1-t)y_i)_{i\\in N})\\geq tg(x)+(1-t)g(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 13.6 的 “continuous extension” 仅指把定义域扩至实立方体，并未要求拓扑连续；这里用 BoxExt 避免把连续性偷加为前提。Convex/Concave 的不等式显式内建。零元数时立方体仍为单元素集。本定义不沿用第12章部分 Boolean 函数的 Ext。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pseudobool]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pseudobool","status":"resolved","id":"04a7d534f0d6e0dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$（see [[27-df-pseudobool]]）；$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n","display":false},{"tex":"N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U_n\\coloneqq[0,1]^N,\\qquad \\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(g(a)=f(a))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x,y\\in U_n\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g((tx_i+(1-t)y_i)_{i\\in N})\\leq tg(x)+(1-t)g(y))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Concave}_n\\coloneqq\\{g:U_n\\to\\mathbb R\\mid\\forall x,y\\in U_n\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;(g((tx_i+(1-t)y_i)_{i\\in N})\\geq tg(x)+(1-t)g(y))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1722,"backlinks":[{"id":"196449e4ff7c48d2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$p\\in U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"a0acb3965b289fee","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$\\chi_A$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]）。"},{"id":"2ad3e401f85da77f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$p\\in U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"c57bdf80f8f006ca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$；$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]），$c_f$（see [[27-df-pbcoeff]]），$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$。"},{"id":"ad75b8281d1ab01e","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$；$b:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\mathbb R$，$A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P(N)$，记 $b_k=b(k)$（$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}$），$A_k=A(k)$、$B_k=B(k)$（$k\\in[m]$）。假设 $\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\land A_k\\cup B_k\\neq\\varnothing)$。$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 满足 $\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j))$。$U_n$（see [[27-df-pbextension]]）。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-284","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-pbextension|df-pbextension — Extensions to the solid cube and convexity]]"},{"id":"f1791ff3e14b4575","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"可追踪的内部入口依次为 [[27-df-functionalequation]] 与 [[27-df-equationalclass]]，[[27-df-fiterror]] 与 [[27-df-bestfit]]，[[27-df-missingbits]] 与 [[27-df-missingextensions]]，以及 [[27-df-pbextension]]、[[27-df-pbmaxelim]]。它们的完整数学条件仍由各自的 Hypothesis 和 Assertion 给出，本摘要不增加新的数学前提。"},{"id":"8749982edf417a9c","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)$ 见 [[27-df-pbextension]]。"},{"id":"4d1a8a4f021bcbf6","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$，$f(\\chi_\\varnothing)=0$；$\\mathrm{Supermodular}_n,\\mathrm{Submodular}_n$（see [[27-df-submodular]]），$\\mathrm{LovExt},S_\\pi,E_{\\pi,k},\\mathrm{Perm}(N)$（see [[27-thm-lovaszchainformula]]），$\\mathrm{Concave}_n,\\mathrm{Convex}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pbextension]]。"},{"id":"c7ddd9dada5543af","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n(f)$ 见 [[27-df-pbextension]]。"},{"id":"ec3b8ca6d60bdf1f","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"$n,m\\in\\mathbb N$，$N=[n]$；$b:\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}\\to\\mathbb R$，$A,B:[m]\\to\\mathcal P(N)$，记 $b_k=b(k)$（$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m\\}$），$A_k=A(k)$、$B_k=B(k)$（$k\\in[m]$）。假设 $\\forall k\\in[m]\\;(A_k\\cap B_k=\\varnothing\\land A_k\\cup B_k\\ne\\varnothing)$。$f\\in\\mathrm{PseudoBool}_n$ 满足\n$\\forall a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=b_0+\\sum_{k=1}^m b_k\\prod_{i\\in A_k}a_i\\prod_{j\\in B_k}(1-a_j))$。\n$\\mathrm{StdExt}_{b,A,B}:U_n\\to\\mathbb R$ 见 [[27-df-pbstandardextension]]，$\\mathrm{BoxExt}_n,\\mathrm{Concave}_n$ 取其上游 [[27-df-pbextension]]。"}],"outgoing":["04a7d534f0d6e0dd"]}